# Spec-First

1. Read the relevant file in `specifications/` before changing runtime, agents, platform, or shared.
2. Spec changes require an ADR in `architecture/DECISIONS.md`.
3. New implementation files include an `implements:` reference and a machine-readable YAML/JSON block where applicable.
4. `data-spec.md` changes precede `platform/DATA_DICTIONARY.md` changes.
